        "is_free": true,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>WELCOME BACK TO SCHOOL</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>35 of your classmates were murdered.</strong> Law enforcement's response was to cover everything up. Not a single living soul could tell you the whole story, so you decide to find out for yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take on the role of Amanda,</strong> an aspiring podcaster who yearns for a good story- something to really get some people tuning in. You break into your own high school to investigate, finding the truth behind the murders and uncovering that the truth is far more sinister than you could've ever imagined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be aware at all times.</strong> With limited movement options, you'll have to decide when's best to make your move. It <i>will</i> hear you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plan ahead</strong>. Unlock various shortcuts and hidden pathways in the school to assist you in navigating throughout. Be sure of your route in order to avoid any unwanted encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>WHAT TO EXPECT</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive into a full, fleshed out psychological horror experience.</strong> Senior Sunset offers a linear story with gameplay that can vary between cautious, slow, and calculated &amp; intense and fast-paced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beware of him</strong>. A constant, looming threat is ever-present throughout your descent into the school. It will do everything in its power to hunt you down. With its advanced detection &amp; reactive capabilities, nowhere is safe for long.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The school</strong> is a dark, detailed location packed full of places to explore. Slowly unlock different rooms and halls as you journey through with little to no navigational assistance.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>WELCOME BACK TO SCHOOL</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>35 of your classmates were murdered.</strong> Law enforcement's response was to cover everything up. Not a single living soul could tell you the whole story, so you decide to find out for yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take on the role of Amanda,</strong> an aspiring podcaster who yearns for a good story- something to really get some people tuning in. You break into your own high school to investigate, finding the truth behind the murders and uncovering that the truth is far more sinister than you could've ever imagined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be aware at all times.</strong> With limited movement options, you'll have to decide when's best to make your move. It <i>will</i> hear you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plan ahead</strong>. Unlock various shortcuts and hidden pathways in the school to assist you in navigating throughout. Be sure of your route in order to avoid any unwanted encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>WHAT TO EXPECT</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive into a full, fleshed out psychological horror experience.</strong> Senior Sunset offers a linear story with gameplay that can vary between cautious, slow, and calculated &amp; intense and fast-paced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beware of him</strong>. A constant, looming threat is ever-present throughout your descent into the school. It will do everything in its power to hunt you down. With its advanced detection &amp; reactive capabilities, nowhere is safe for long.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The school</strong> is a dark, detailed location packed full of places to explore. Slowly unlock different rooms and halls as you journey through with little to no navigational assistance.</p>",
